# Production troubleshooting (boost app)

## Never without explicit user approval

- Do **not** POST `/api/boost`, run “boost all”, or place real panel orders against videos in the user’s approval queue or production batch.
- Do **not** use random TikTok URLs from the queue as test targets.

## Designated live test URL

When the user asks to verify boosts, routing, or panel integration on production, use **only**:

`https://vt.tiktok.com/ZSbj7DF8u/`

Prefer single, user-approved test orders on that URL — not queue items or “boost all”.

## Read-only checks (OK without asking)

- Render logs, `/api/config`, code review, local mocks with fake URLs.
